[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7620.149, "timestamp": "02:07:00", "text": "我非常喜欢这个。期末考试很有趣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7627.75, "timestamp": "02:07:07", "text": "我再也玩不了那个游戏了。我的电脑"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7631.43, "timestamp": "02:07:11", "text": "受不了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7635.03, "timestamp": "02:07:15", "text": "虽然很遗憾，但我的电脑无法……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7642.87, "timestamp": "02:07:22", "text": "复制。放在这里。但这是一款好游戏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7645.03, "timestamp": "02:07:25", "text": "很喜欢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7647.99, "timestamp": "02:07:27", "text": "享受其中的每一刻。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7651.27, "timestamp": "02:07:31", "text": "我最初是在 2023 年播放的。[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7653.669, "timestamp": "02:07:33", "text": "从现在开始，一切都将……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7657.683, "timestamp": "02:07:37", "text": "比如2023年之类的，因为我们现在是2023年。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7660.069, "timestamp": "02:07:40", "text": "[嗤笑] 2023年。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7664.39, "timestamp": "02:07:44", "text": "那段时间。我暂停播放。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7666.31, "timestamp": "02:07:46", "text": "下载它。 [清嗓子]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7669.91, "timestamp": "02:07:49", "text": "我们要回归旧有的模式。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7675.75, "timestamp": "02:07:55", "text": "保存"}]